esponsibility for instruction and supervision."}, {"id": "2ec734bc-5a99-448f-a23e-e2e1657a99e3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Communication and feedback", "children": [{"id": "16c3fee8-3467-4c07-8081-a55fd070d637", "type": "concept", "title": "Plans, schedules, prompts, data, and debriefs"}, {"id": "4aac75ac-829e-410e-bed1-27c8b096cece", "type": "concept", "title": "Modeling, observation, coaching, and corrective feedback"}, {"id": "0c339927-1cb2-4955-9b0f-716eff1f80a1", "type": "concept", "title": "Cultural/linguistic assets and team inclusion"}], "description": "The goal is clear, respectful partnership."}, {"id": "bee11ed2-fdce-4e89-bacd-9dbe012f4a7c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Independence and inclusion", "children": [{"id": "9ffaf232-ad2a-4c48-8870-9600112ebb66", "type": "concept", "title": "Prompt hierarchy and fading"}, {"id": "f7c761a4-f837-4b4a-b32e-30ea9daaffc6", "type": "concept", "title": "Peer supports and natural cues"}, {"id": "ed3ca70f-f59a-4a82-b561-8406b25edd12", "type": "concept", "title": "Data on independence, participation, and proximity"}], "description": "Students prevent overprompting and adult-created isolation."}]}, {"id": "1afee145-ccfa-479f-84d6-930e89215a74", "type": "topic", "title": "18. Family, Student, and Interprofessional Collaboration", "description": "Partner with families and learners as experts and coordinate with specialists around shared goals.", "children": [{"id": "71507138-250a-4cad-9ded-ec1d59d3c696", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Family partnership", "children": [{"id": "91cf6b4c-0e0a-49eb-82c9-98233a1fc21f", "type": "concept", "title": "Strengths, priorities, culture, language, and family routines"}, {"id": "b0338dfb-f498-4c3c-962f-e71bf393538f", "type": "concept", "title": "Flexible meetings, interpreters, and understandable documents"}, {"id": "cc223dea-4b85-41d8-8c46-0b63d105b7b4", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflict, repair, and procedural rights"}], "description": "Students build trust through reciprocity and accessible communication."}, {"id": "67016e66-0a79-4af9-b61b-bc40a7875cf8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Student voice and self-determination", "children": [{"id": "796ed837-308f-4428-9dff-1eceaedde68d", "type": "concept", "title": "Preferences, strengths, goals, choices, and self-advocacy"}, {"id": "1502ab25-9c68-4b6a-98e3-57791c7d13f4", "type": "concept", "title": "Student-led IEP elements"}, {"id": "a04a0564-d259-49c6-8dea-f5d81ef1f51b", "type": "concept", "title": "Decision making, problem solving, and dignity of risk"}], "description": "The point is meaningful participation at every age."}, {"id": "a9387dae-309f-464b-bd19-ecbc26403ddb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Interprofessional teamwork", "children": [{"id": "d72d610e-d654-420b-9178-22dfb67a6d61", "type": "concept", "title": "Special educator, SLP, OT, PT, psychologist, counselor, nurse, behavior specialist"}, {"id": "5cd9c17a-99b4-499c-b450-79f7a192d995", "type": "concept", "title": "Shared goals, role clarity, consultation, and transdisciplinary strategies"}, {"id": "f20759de-0f57-4baa-b392-368983145ba1", "type": "concept", "title": "Care coordination and community agencies"}], "description": "Students integrate expertise without fragmenting the child."}]}, {"id": "58889a90-8564-43d2-9afc-7609772a9f86", "type": "topic", "title": "19. Transition Planning Across Grades and into Adult Life", "description": "Treat transition as a continuous process of building agency, skills, experiences, and coordinated supports.", "children": [{"id": "04960ad4-0768-4841-bb06-d30e5bebe495", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Early and grade-to-grade transition", "children": [{"id": "d8c971bf-d115-4b23-a829-39c105741160", "type": "concept", "title": "Records, routines, relationships, and environment"}, {"id": "f9cd118f-9a3c-4c6e-9e73-c92eb73d61fe", "type": "concept", "title": "Kindergarten/middle-school transitions"}, {"id": "0baab6b0-f55c-495b-8186-ad00594eb202", "type": "concept", "title": "Summer, hospitalization, and reentry"}], "description": "Students plan continuity across classrooms, schools, and developmental changes."}, {"id": "b69bc380-0152-4b55-8cb5-68ac5d9340b1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Secondary transition concepts", "children": [{"id": "09d674fe-9491-47f6-91ef-710aab91823c", "type": "concept", "title": "Education/training, employment, independent/community living"}, {"id": "57006149-bd50-44ac-9f6d-0bb23a04e6a9", "type": "concept", "title": "Age-appropriate transition assessment"}, {"id": "564ba96f-37db-483e-b84d-00f7eff0f5aa", "type": "concept", "title": "Courses, experiences, services, and agency linkages"}], "description": "Elementary teachers learn the long arc toward adult outcomes."}, {"id": "acaba4e2-f574-41cd-8dc8-d46ead7bc955", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Self-determination", "children": [{"id": "63b3e1b9-337f-4a49-a7af-274fc3ee39a0", "type": "concept", "title": "Choice, goal setting, self-monitoring, and self-advocacy"}, {"id": "48ae4be6-8e05-4340-a1bb-72195e14f54c", "type": "concept", "title": "Strengths-based future planning"}, {"id": "aa767c47-f043-4a5e-b400-a60c6a7b3e13", "type": "concept", "title": "Supported decision-making concepts"}], "description": "The goal is increasing student control and participation."}]}, {"id": "410e96ce-03d8-4fcd-8342-30676210aaa0", "type": "topic", "title": "20. Culturally Sustaining, Linguistically Responsive, and Equitable Inclusion", "description": "Design support that respects identity and avoids racialized, linguistic, disability, and disciplinary inequities.", "children": [{"id": "2169c2cf-bf02-44eb-b34a-9d731ebe8527", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Culture and language", "children": [{"id": "78391910-7d5e-4d90-b4b8-ad79da955acd", "type": "concept", "title": "Language acquisition and cross-linguistic assessment"}, {"id": "4bf3fca9-0604-414f-bea8-0edc6c73fd96", "type": "concept", "title": "Home language as asset"}, {"id": "4eb598de-4b1d-4e9f-a618-bdc32dee5221", "type": "concept", "title": "Interpreters and bilingual