 "Call trained support and protect peers"}], "description": "Students use relationship, environment, communication, and regulation supports."}, {"id": "05901478-d054-4384-b0bd-76c58cf7bea2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Emergency response", "children": [{"id": "2d5f550a-5608-4819-b330-9cb08895340b", "type": "concept", "title": "Immediate danger threshold and emergency procedures"}, {"id": "439b565b-ab7a-472a-881d-3cf8e0cb67f4", "type": "concept", "title": "Medical, behavioral, elopement, abuse/neglect, and crisis reporting"}, {"id": "354a7782-4b9a-4f5e-b33e-0a9b5598673a", "type": "concept", "title": "Documentation, family notification, and debrief"}], "description": "The goal is least restrictive, trained, policy-compliant action."}, {"id": "aea97f78-8e6c-421e-897f-745db1d6ab3f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Restraint and seclusion safeguards", "children": [{"id": "5eedcda2-0cd7-4b6a-8b31-df88c34c43b8", "type": "concept", "title": "Never for punishment, convenience, or instructional compliance"}, {"id": "381fb853-dad1-4593-8fb4-012d2b1edf96", "type": "concept", "title": "Follow current law/district policy and trained procedures"}, {"id": "8da65436-5007-44b6-89dd-7b5a4ff924a9", "type": "concept", "title": "Review inequities, injuries, antecedents, and prevention plan"}], "description": "Students understand serious risk and prevention."}]}, {"id": "8e1df10b-97c9-4b16-8d1c-b09d35d1dfc4", "type": "topic", "title": "22. Inclusive Field-Based Practice and Professional Portfolio", "description": "Integrate planning, instruction, collaboration, assessment, and reflection in authentic elementary settings.", "children": [{"id": "a0c6bfb3-b0b2-47fe-9e17-e1f39cb3641a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Inclusive lesson cycle", "children": [{"id": "7e94d7db-78a5-4451-a6aa-4eb4971278a2", "type": "concept", "title": "Standards, learner variability, UDL, SDI, accommodations, and AT"}, {"id": "d44ab45a-63ba-4e30-8f6c-b68dbd9dffb0", "type": "concept", "title": "Co-teaching/paraprofessi